# CHANGES

Reverse chronological summary of every commit in this repository.

2026-05-08  ebcbe02  Update demos and runtime to latest sw-cor24-plsw
---------------------------------------------------------------------
- Add the upstream Define, Select, Select Nested, and five Storage allocator demos (Basic, Coalesce, Double Free, OOM, Size Mismatch).
- Update Loop to print 1-10 with PRINT_INT and Record to use inline `ADDR('label = ')` strings to match the latest upstream sources.
- Switch the Assembler import to the new `cor24-assembler` crate (the emulator crate no longer re-exports it after the recent split).
- Rebuild Pages output.

2026-05-03  9469440  Fix IEFBR14 reference in empty module demo
-------------------------------------------------------------
- Restore the correct IEFBR14 spelling in the Empty Module demo's description and source comment.
- Rebuild Pages output.

2026-05-01  a2b152c  Print Record demo values as decimal digits
---------------------------------------------------------------
- Replace the `+48` single-digit shortcut in the Record demo with a `PRINT_INT` proc that emits a divide-by-10 digit buffer, so `SUM` prints as `10` instead of `:` when `X + Y` exceeds 9.
- Rebuild Pages output.

2026-05-01  bcc7be0  Show assembler object listings
----------------------------------------------------
- Show assembler object listings with machine-code bytes in the normal Assemble step.
- Align PL/EDIT macro invocation templates and browser preprocessing with `?NAME(KEYWORD(value))` syntax.
- Fix PL/EDIT record DCL templates and Format output for `NAME(dim) CHAR` fields and level-number indentation.
- Update PL/EDIT, PRD, and architecture docs, plus Pages build artifacts.

2026-05-01  f1e3cdc  Fix PL/EDIT editing and formatting
--------------------------------------------------------
- Fix source editor caret alignment by using the native textarea as the visible editing surface.
- Make .msw Format buttons format the current editor buffer even when the textarea is not mounted.
- Normalize intra-line spacing before PL/SW and .msw Format indentation decisions.
- Make the multi-file project demo print numeric PROC results with PRINT_INT and include an ADD3 example.
- Update README, PL/EDIT docs, PRD, design notes, and Pages build artifacts.

2026-05-01  625c652  Allow source PL/EDIT templates in macro editors
---------------------------------------------------------------------
- Allow PL/EDIT source templates such as IF to expand inside .msw macro editors.
- Update PL/EDIT docs and Pages build artifacts.

2026-04-30  afaab2c  Fix footer CHANGES link
---------------------------------------------
- Fix the footer CHANGES link to open the GitHub file view instead of a copied site artifact.
- Remove the copied CHANGES Pages artifact and rebuild Pages output.

2026-04-30  0d5f0c3  Add Mass Compile queue workflow
-----------------------------------------------------
- Add Mass Compile dialog for queued demo compile/assemble/run jobs.
- Add selectable per-job logs with compiler input, compiler output, generated assembly, assembler listing or errors, and run output or errors.
- Add queued source drafts, per-job scratch edits, waiting-on-dirty-save behavior, and cooperative compile-time yielding.
- Document the Mass Compile workflow and update README, PRD, design notes, and Pages build artifacts.

2026-04-30  e218481  Add PL/EDIT templates and formatter
---------------------------------------------------------
- Add PL/EDIT, an optional hotkey-driven source editor mode with F4/Ctrl-Space template expansion, Tab/Enter field navigation, help, and fullscreen editing.
- Add branch-printing demos, an empty default module, and a multi-file project skeleton using .msw include units for DCLs, PROCs, and MACRODEFs.
- Add this CHANGES file and link it from the application footer.
- Add a Format button for PL/SW-style indentation and a generated favicon.
- Update README, design, architecture, and product requirements docs for PL/EDIT and the expanded demo set.

